      "en": "Never start without a **deposit** (30–50%) — it protects you and confirms the client is serious. Tie payments to measurable milestones. Set **payment terms** (7 or 14 days), the method (transfer, Wise, Payoneer) and the currency. If the client is late: a friendly then firm reminder (week 39 of the English journey), and pause new work until payment."
